trufflehog
----------
The detector patterns in pkg/builtin (processor_regex.go and
processor_regex_upstream.go) are derived from the detectors in
https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog, Copyright (c) Truffle Security
Co., licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. The patterns
were modified: they were adapted to a line-based regex processor, reduced to a
single capture group, and in some cases given narrower keywords. Because this
project includes work derived from trufflehog, the project as a whole is
distributed under the AGPL-3.0.

